<title>USA: Balchem Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Balchem Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>SLATE HILL, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000 Omitted Except for Net Earnings Per Share)</p>
<p>			For the Three Months Ended September 30</p>
<p>						    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Sales					    6,654	  6,499</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Operating Profit		     768	    630</p>
<p> Taxes						248	    235</p>
<p> Net Income					 520	    395</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			   0.165	  0.125</p>
<p>			 For the Nine Months Ended September 30</p>
<p>						    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Sales					   19,736	 18,263</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Operating Profit		   2,171	  1,746</p>
<p> Taxes						744	    620</p>
<p> Net Income				     1,427	  1,126</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			    0.45	   0.35</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
